# Upload filter for the bandit image build (cloudbuild.bandit.yaml):
#   gcloud builds submit --config deployment/bandit/cloudbuild.bandit.yaml \
#     --ignore-file deployment/bandit/bandit.gcloudignore ... .
# bandit_stack/bandit_serving/Dockerfile (the one bandit image) only COPYs from
# bandit_stack/ (bandit/, bandit_serving/, bandit_traffic/), so upload just that.
/*
!/bandit_stack/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
